# dev_delegate_exec — END-TO-END execution eval for the DELEGATE verb (Gap D).
# Unlike dev_delegate.jsonl (prompt-only, fixture context), this runs each goal through
# the LIVE DevAgent.plan_and_run, so the REAL _plan_and_run_locked injects the DELEGATE
# teaching and a DELEGATE step actually runs _delegate_investigate end-to-end against the
# repo. READ-ONLY ONLY (a destructive plan fail-safe-DENYs unattended). Run:
#   DA_DELEGATE=1 python -m evals.run --suite dev_delegate_exec --mode execution --check
# Goals name real repo entities so the investigation has something to find. Scored on the
# ACTUALLY-EXECUTED verbs (AgentResult.steps); `safe_ok` fails the case if a forbidden
# verb runs. The trivial-read case guards against DELEGATE over-use.
